Diff base: \`origin/main\`. Review with \`git diff --merge-base 'origin/main' -- ':(literal)crates/core/src/lib.rs' ':(literal)crates/core/src/it'\\''s.rs'\`.
YOUR SLICE: \`crates/core\` — 2 changed file(s) of a larger diff. Sibling lenses hold the rest, and overlapping findings are de-duplicated downstream.
