- [High] races on shared map (src/a.rs:10)

Return {lens: "negative-space", findings: [...]} using the shared finding schema. Set \`ruleId\` to the matching nix-review rules.md ID or "" if none fits. Observability: the workflow records this run — do NOT write your own record."
`;

