- DEFERRED QUESTION — anything else: list it in \`questions\` and go on. List EVERY question you asked in \`questions\` (blocking: true if you wrote a q-file, answered: true if its answer came), naming the finding that depends on it in findingTitle and findingFile; a finding that rests on an unanswered question says so in \`why\`.
- whereChecked: premises inside \`crates/core/\` pinned to a file:line you opened; a premise about another crate is a question, not a whereChecked entry.
- blastRadius: the public items of this crate the change touches; consumers in other crates are the seam pass's, not yours.
- A defect located in another crate is not yours; do not report it.
LAST STEP, always, findings or not: \`touch '/tmp/ch'/done-u1-r2\`.

