exports[`scout prompts render as before > scout nix full based 1`] = `
"You are scouting a Nix diff to plan an elastic review. Use shell + read only — do NOT review yet.

SCOPE: review ONLY the crate/dir at \`crates/core\`. Pass \`-- 'crates/core'\` to every \`git diff\` command below.

Diff base: \`origin/main\`. Consider only this profile's files ('*.nix' 'flake.lock').
1. Inspect \`git diff --stat 'origin/main'...HEAD -- '*.nix' 'flake.lock'\`. Set sizeBucket:
   small = a few files / < ~80 changed lines; large = many files / > ~400 lines or a public-API-heavy change; medium otherwise.
2. lenses: choose from ["purity","reproducibility","injection","packaging","dev-env","modules","maintainability","intent"].
